</section>

<section class="py-5 bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold">Frequently Asked Questions for Contractors</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse1">
                        What information should I include on a contractor invoice?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        A contractor invoice should include your business name, license number (if required), contact info, client details, invoice number, project description, itemized labor (hours or fixed price), materials, equipment rental, travel, any deposits paid, tax amount, and total due with payment terms.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse2">
                        Is this contractor invoice generator really free?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes! RatPDF's invoice generator is completely free for contractors. There are no hidden fees, subscriptions, or watermarks. You can create unlimited invoices and download them as PDF files at no cost.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse3">
                        Can I add labor hours and materials separately?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Absolutely. You can add multiple line items – for example, "10 hours $75/hr" for labor, "Lumber – 200 board feet" for materials, "Mini excavator rental" for equipment – each with its own quantity, rate, and tax setting.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq4">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse4">
                        Does it support deposits and progress billing?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes. You can enter a deposit or advance payment, and the invoice will automatically show the remaining balance due. For large projects, you can create separate invoices for each progress payment.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq5">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse5">
                        Do I need to create an account to generate invoices?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        No account or sign-up is required. You can start creating invoices immediately, and we don't store any of your data. Your privacy is protected.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

